					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-564797#post-1569406</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-564797/scp-1394-j#post-1569406</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 20 Sep 2012 19:17:54 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>wishun</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1204404</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Easy fix: pick either the tab side or the open side, put a little dab of elmer's glue on that side of the cable head (on the plastic, not the actual connector bit). Once it dries, you can tell at a glance, or even just by touch, which way up the cable is.</p> <p>If you put a simlar dab on the coresponding slot-side of your devices, you can plug in a cable first time, every time, even in the dark.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
